,"en_gloss":"(44)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:44"}]},{"verse_key":"36:45","surah":36,"ayah":45,"ar_uthmani":"وَإِذَا قِيلَ لَهُمُ ٱتَّقُوا۟ مَا بَيْنَ أَيْدِيكُمْ وَمَا خَلْفَكُمْ لَعَلَّكُمْ تُرْحَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Yet when they are told, ‘Beware of what lies before and behind you, so that you may be given mercy,’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَإِذَا","en_gloss":"And when","transliteration":"wa-idhā","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":2,"ar":"قِيلَ","en_gloss":"it is said","transliteration":"qīla","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لَهُمُ","en_gloss":"to them","transliteration":"lahumu","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱتَّقُوا۟","en_gloss":"Fear","transliteration":"ittaqū","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"what","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":6,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"(is) before you","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَيْدِيكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) before you","transliteration":"aydīkum","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"and what","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":9,"ar":"خَلْفَكُمْ","en_gloss":"(is) behind you","transliteration":"khalfakum","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":10,"ar":"لَعَلَّكُمْ","en_gloss":"so that you may","transliteration":"laʿallakum","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":11,"ar":"تُرْحَمُونَ","en_gloss":"receive mercy","transliteration":"tur'ḥamūna","verse_key":"36:45"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٤٥","en_gloss":"(45)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"36:45"}]},{"verse_key":"36:46","surah":36,"ayah":46,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا تَأْتِيهِم مِّنْ ءَايَةٍ مِّنْ ءَايَـٰتِ رَبِّهِمْ إِلَّا كَانُوا۟ عَنْهَا مُعْرِضِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"they ignore every single sign that comes to them from their Lord,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"36:46"},{"pos":2,"ar":"تَأْتِيهِم","en_gloss":"comes to them","transliteration":"tatīhim","verse_key":"36:46"},{"pos":3,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","tran